{"thread":{"threadID":4129,"boardID":58,"topic":"CSGO Fehler","time":1485696243,"userID":2351,"username":"Tim","lastPostTime":1485796053,"lastPoster":"Mike","replies":16,"views":518,"attachments":1,"isSticky":0,"isClosed":1,"cumulativeLikes":0},"tags":[],"posts":[{"postID":60680,"threadID":4129,"userID":2351,"username":"Tim","subject":"CSGO Fehler","time":1485696243,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[{"attachmentID":889,"objectID":60680,"filename":"Unbenannt.PNG","filesize":6440,"fileType":"image/png","isImage":1,"width":408,"height":154,"downloads":124,"uploadTime":1485696214}],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Kann mir jemand schnell helfen!!!Ich habe Probleme CSGO zu starten.Kennt wer eine Lösung.<br><span class=\"metacode-inline\"></span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60681,"threadID":4129,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1485696355,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Rechts Klick in der Steam Bibliothek auf CS:GO &gt; Eigenschaften &gt; Lokale Dateien &gt; Spieldaten auf Fehler überprüfen</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60682,"threadID":4129,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1485696687,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>NekoCedx3</strong></cite><p>Rechts Klick in der Steam Bibliothek auf CS:GO &gt; Eigenschaften &gt; Lokale Dateien &gt; Spieldaten auf Fehler überprüfen<br></p></blockquote><p>sollte in der Tat dem Fehler beheben. Kann ich closen?</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60683,"threadID":4129,"userID":2351,"username":"Tim","subject":"","time":1485697303,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Geht immernoch nicht</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60684,"threadID":4129,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1485699268,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Dann weiß ichs auch nicht. Re-Install? Nimmste dir vorher deinen csgo Ordner (Also den in common/ACCOUNTNAME/Counter Strike GO/csgo) und fügst ihn später wieder ein (dann musste die maps und so nicht wieder neu laden und hast auch deine cfg noch)</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60685,"threadID":4129,"userID":2351,"username":"Tim","subject":"","time":1485699374,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":-1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","time":1485699952,"value":-1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Zaka hat mir geholfen.Aber danke.<br>ZakariaForPresident oder auch T-Admin</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60686,"threadID":4129,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1485700431,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Lösung war?</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Edit: nächstes mal bitte ins richtige Topic posten //moved</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60687,"threadID":4129,"userID":1153,"username":"Schockly","subject":"","time":1485702058,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Würde mich auch interessieren, falls ich auch mal den Fehler habe <span class=\"archive-emoji\">🙂</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60689,"threadID":4129,"userID":2351,"username":"Tim","subject":"","time":1485707298,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>es geht doch nicht.Habe gedacht es funktioniert.Bitte falls ihr weitere lösungen habt!</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60690,"threadID":4129,"userID":2498,"username":"Chris","subject":"","time":1485707925,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Versuch mal Steam zu De-installieren, und wieder Installieren und das selbe mit CSGO aber bevor du CSGO startest überprüfe es auf Fehler</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60691,"threadID":4129,"userID":2223,"username":"NekoCedx3","subject":"","time":1485709049,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ansonsten Config speichern , Userdata speichern und Fonts (falls du welche benutzt) und CS:GO deinstallieren oder vllt weißt du seit wann der Fehler ist / Was du in der zwischen Zeit gemacht hast.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60698,"threadID":4129,"userID":2338,"username":"[eXo]","subject":"","time":1485724493,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":3,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","time":1485788647,"value":1},{"userID":2428,"username":"SNEAKZ","time":1485800111,"value":1},{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1485803397,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>oder du machst das<br><span class=\"missing-media\">[Bild]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60699,"threadID":4129,"userID":2378,"username":"Verdia","subject":"","time":1485724971,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":1,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[{"userID":1173,"username":"Nightlight","time":1485803401,"value":1}],"bodyHtml":"<p>Ich hab auf OK gedrückt<br>GG</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60711,"threadID":4129,"userID":2043,"username":"ApudoX","subject":"","time":1485773162,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Wenn dein Spiel immernoch nicht funktioniert, dann Installier Steam neu, soll angeblich helfen.</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p>Was ich auch gelesen habe ist, dass dein Anti Viren Programm eine Datei blockiert ( HLMV.exe ) und deswegen das Spiel nicht gestartet werden kann.<br>Ich blende dir mal das Zitat ein:</p>\n<p><br></p>\n<p><br></p>\n<blockquote class=\"archive-quote\"><cite>Zitat von <strong>✪ SmokY.sui</strong></cite><p>Ja dein Antivirus Blockiert die HLMV.exe datei ( Half life) ... schau in der Quarantene nach und wiederherstell das wieder... dan sollte es wieder gehn.. so wars zumindest bei mir! hoffe hilft dir weiter... °oder auf antivirus echtzeitscan ausschalten°<br></p></blockquote><p>Ich hoffe ich konnte dir bei deinem Problem helfen, sollte es immernoch nicht gehen, schreib mir nochmal.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60725,"threadID":4129,"userID":2237,"username":"Gaara","subject":"","time":1485788105,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Es funktioniert, da ich ihn gestern auf TTT gesehen habe.</p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60726,"threadID":4129,"userID":2318,"username":"PEYZO","subject":"","time":1485788602,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":"","attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>Er hats gfixt ALSO MIKE CLOSE , hab dich Lieb  <span class=\"missing-media\">[cookie*]</span></p>","polls":[]},{"postID":60727,"threadID":4129,"userID":1812,"username":"Mike","subject":"","time":1485796053,"lastEditTime":0,"editCount":0,"editReason":null,"attachments":[],"cumulativeLikes":0,"editorID":null,"editor":"","likes":[],"bodyHtml":"<p>closed</p>","polls":[]}]}